  "caveats": [
    "WINDOWS LICENCE NOT INCLUDED IN THESE PRICES and not verifiable: vultr.com pricing pages return a Cloudflare bot challenge; the support doc gives no amount. Third-party (checkthat.ai) reports +$16/mo on the $10 plan and +$128/mo on the $160 (8 vCPU) plan, i.e. ~$16 per vCPU-month (~$0.024/vCPU-h at 672 h). Estimates from this card understate Windows cost by that amount.",
    "The /v2/plans API hourly_cost field (e.g. $0.055 for the $40 plan = /730) disagrees with the billing doc (/672 = $0.0595); card follows the billing doc.",
    "Each plan includes a monthly bandwidth allowance (e.g. 4,096 GB on vc2-4c-8gb per API); overage price not verified (egress_gib null).",
    "Plan availability varies by location (30-31 locations for vc2)."
  ],
